description	"Sidon Ithano aka the Crimson Corsair

A reckless, mobile hybrid with a one-tap Shotgun and a Grappling Hook.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrocutlass
-- Saber Defense (1)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- No Blaster Block
- ACP Array Gun (Shotgun 2)
-- 100% more Dmg
-- 5% faster Mag Reload
- Pulse Grenades (3)

^6Inventory:
- Portable E-Web Cannon
- Stimpak

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook/Hop (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
-- Retain momentum from first Grapple"